{"id":"vod_sn_36022","vodId":"36022","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔法科高校的劣等生","name_cn":"魔法科高校的劣等生","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/f8b0988cc57cf4431de58f7ed240e53b.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在二十一世纪末，彼时，魔法早就已经不再仅存与神话和传说之中，而是同科学与超能力融合，成为了人尽皆知的存在。国家甚至成立了魔法大学附属第一高校，专门培养此方面的人才，以便更好的为国家效力。　　司波达也（中村悠一 配音）和妹妹司波深雪（早见沙织 配音）是魔法高校的新生，深雪是能力优秀的“花冠”，而达也则是作为其替补的二科生“杂草”。在学园中，兄妹两人结识了许多有趣的同伴们——个性大大咧咧不拘小节的千叶艾丽卡（内山夕实 配音）、文静胆小的柴田美月（佐藤聪美 配音）、正直勇敢的西城雷欧哈鲁特（寺岛拓笃 配音）、认真努力的吉田干比古（田丸笃志 配音），在学习的过程中，存在于学园之中的秘密也在逐渐揭晓。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VaWsEp3rBt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4cN1xekDpM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uq90xLrvem1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0AN6CCPum11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Rsn44dYT651/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gdNf0uDS5J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J8zRJYGaVW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QTzhjddfEm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E9L19ypM861/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/firq9T5RKq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1wpQbHZwqG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HraBNqxFfQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GxNWjc0EfY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/j90ZsbbL4r1/video/in